        1488,
        1360
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Except as otherwise provided in section 2 of this order, for the duration of the current state of local emergency, the streets and highways of the City are closed for vehicular traffic, effective 11 p.m. on January 26, 2015.",
